<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Safeway Inc restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Safeway Inc restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it resumed coverage of Safeway Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.  </p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley later said it had set a 12-month price target of $58 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- said expects Safeway to earn $2.40 a share in 1997 and $2.90 a share in 1998.</p>
</text>
